  <!-- Riverpod -->
  <h2 id="riverpod">Riverpod</h2>
  <p class="not-prose text-sm text-muted-foreground"><a href="https://github.com/rrousselGit/riverpod" class="underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-foreground">github.com/rrousselGit/riverpod</a></p>

  <p><strong>Platform:</strong> Dart (Flutter) &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong>Pattern:</strong> Provider graph</p>

  <p>Riverpod uses providers as small units of state and computation. Dependencies are tracked via <code>ref.watch()</code>: when Provider A watches Provider B, Riverpod records that dependency and can rebuild A when B changes.</p>

